<metadata><name>Day 47 (stop 1 of 2) - Mission Road-01., Mission Road</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.495660" lon="-80.321846"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Blue Mountain Resort parking area, off of Swiss Meadows Blvd</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.490824" lon="-80.318163"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Mission Road Side Trail, heading south. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.489285" lon="-80.309176"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Mission Road Side Trail-01., heading south. The next 2.1 km follows an unopened road allowance (rough track, no traffic).</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.480053" lon="-80.307085"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turnaround point. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
